@RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5189
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt
@tenantToken = replace-with-tenant-jwt

GET {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Update room price, occupancy, and description
PUT {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 3500000,
  "maxOccupancy": 3,
  "description": "Phòng đã cập nhật"
}

### Update tenant contact and identity information
PUT {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0900000000",
  "cccd": "012345678901"
}

### Update an unpaid bill (room price remains unchanged)
PUT {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/bills/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "electricityOld": 100,
  "electricityNew": 150,
  "electricityPrice": 3500,
  "waterPrice": 150000,
  "servicePrice": 100000,
  "month": 5,
  "year": 2026
}

### Update contract tenants and optionally extend the end date
PUT {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contracts/1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantIds": [1, 2],
  "endDate": "2027-05-31T00:00:00"
}

### Initiate VNPay payment for a bill (requires tenant JWT)
POST {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/payment/pay?billId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### VNPay IPN (normally called by VNPay; configure the public ngrok URL in VNPay)
GET {{RoomManagement.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/payment/vnpay-ipn
